### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "mypassword123"}

### Register same email again (expect 409)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Test User", "email": "TEST@example.com", "password": "mypassword123"}

### Who am I before login (expect 401)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "test@example.com", "password": "mypassword123"}

### Who am I after login (expect 200)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "test@example.com", "password": "wrongpassword"}